# Pinned plugins for the live-safe plugin set (Paper).
# Format: name|source|version|url|sha256
#
# Copy this file to the running server's control checkout and fill in every
# placeholder. automation/install-plugins.sh downloads each entry whose url ends
# in .jar and whose sha256 is a real 64-character digest, verifies the digest,
# and copies the jar into the server's plugins/ directory. Entries that still
# contain a placeholder, or whose url is not a .jar, are skipped with a note.
#
# The group's own plugins are built from a pinned source commit with
# automation/build-*.sh, which verifies the jar against the sha256 recorded here.
# Pin an exact version (or commit) and the SHA-256 of the exact jar bytes; never
# follow a moving "latest" download. Do not invent hashes: measure them.
#
# Only place live-safe plugins here. Test-only plugins go in test-plugins.list.

# --- Third-party plugins -----------------------------------------------------
